  "description": "Arena allocator with typed handles and intrusive collections for .NET.\n      Fixed-size blocks, no per-node GC objects, stable handles for the lifetime\n      of the node. Includes a doubly linked list and two red-black trees.\n      Built for long-running, single-threaded workloads with very large working\n      sets: 24 bytes per key and roughly half the insert time of SortedSet at\n      50 million keys.",
  "id": "Holdfast",
